==============================================================================
PART 2: EXPLICIT MONOMIAL EQUIVALENCE AT ORDERS 2, 4, 8 (skew_k ~ sylvester_k)
==============================================================================

order 2: status=FOUND  nodes=2  time=0.000s
  row perm sigma (target i <- source sigma[i]): [0, 1]
  row signs eps:  [1, 1]
  col perm tau  (target j <- source tau[j]):   [1, 0]
  col signs delta:[1, 1]
  verified: sylvester[i,j] = eps[i]*delta[j]*skew[sigma[i],tau[j]]  EXACT

order 4: status=FOUND  nodes=5  time=0.000s
  row perm sigma (target i <- source sigma[i]): [0, 1, 2, 3]
  row signs eps:  [1, 1, 1, -1]
  col perm tau  (target j <- source tau[j]):   [1, 2, 3, 0]
  col signs delta:[1, 1, 1, 1]
  verified: sylvester[i,j] = eps[i]*delta[j]*skew[sigma[i],tau[j]]  EXACT

order 8: status=FOUND  nodes=15  time=0.000s
  row perm sigma (target i <- source sigma[i]): [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 7, 5, 6]
  row signs eps:  [1, 1, 1, -1, 1, -1, -1, 1]
  col perm tau  (target j <- source tau[j]):   [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 0]
  col signs delta:[1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1]
  verified: sylvester[i,j] = eps[i]*delta[j]*skew[sigma[i],tau[j]]  EXACT

==============================================================================
PART 3: ORDER-16 INVARIANTS — skew_16 vs sylvester_16
==============================================================================

sylvester_16:
  row-quadruple profile (|sum| -> count, total C(16,4)=1820): {0: 1680, 16: 140}
  col-quadruple profile (transpose):                          {0: 1680, 16: 140}
  SNF(H)        own: 1 2^4 4^6 8^4 16   sympy: 1 2^4 4^6 8^4 16  agree=True
  SNF((H+J)/2)  own: 1^5 2^6 4^4 8   sympy: 1^5 2^6 4^4 8  agree=True
  GF(2) rank of (H+J)/2: 5

skew_16:
  row-quadruple profile (|sum| -> count, total C(16,4)=1820): {0: 1344, 8: 448, 16: 28}
  col-quadruple profile (transpose):                          {0: 1344, 8: 448, 16: 28}
  SNF(H)        own: 1 2^7 8^7 16   sympy: 1 2^7 8^7 16  agree=True
  SNF((H+J)/2)  own: 1^8 4^7 8   sympy: 1^8 4^7 8  agree=True
  GF(2) rank of (H+J)/2: 8

Hall-set counts (quadruples with |sum|=16):
  sylvester_16: 140   skew_16: 28
VERDICT order 16: DIFFERENT profile -> INEQUIVALENT Hadamard matrices

