PART 6: SKEW-WALSH BUTTERFLY — verify + time at order 1024 (and 4096)
==============================================================================
  butterfly EXACT match vs dense matvec at m = 2,4,8,16,64,256,1024 (int64 vectors): True
  block identity S_2m x = [S_m(x1+x2); S_m(x1-x2)-2(x1-x2)] EXACT at m=8,64,512: True

  m=1024: dense matvec (BLAS, prebuilt):      96.7 us | recursive butterfly:    2949.1 us | iterative butterfly:      67.5 us
         matrix build time: 6.7 ms, memory: 8 MB (float64) | speedup iter vs dense: 1.43x, rec vs dense: 0.03x

  m=4096: dense matvec (BLAS, prebuilt):    4330.2 us | recursive butterfly:   11913.3 us | iterative butterfly:     158.2 us
